<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>Come funziona Contatto Veicolo</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Guida proprietario Contatto Veicolo: QR, notifiche, posizione precisa dell'evento, mappa attività e gestione segnalazioni.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --navy:#071421;
      --navy2:#0d2238;
      --blue:#2f6eea;
      --blue2:#6aa4ff;
      --orange:#ff9b38;
      --green:#18a957;
      --red:#d92d20;
      --bg:#eef3fa;
      --panel:#ffffff;
      --text:#172234;
      --muted:#607086;
      --line:rgba(23,34,52,.12);
      --shadow:0 28px 80px rgba(13,34,56,.16);
      --radius:30px;
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box}

    html,body{
      margin:0;
      min-height:100%;
      font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;
      color:var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 16% 4%, rgba(106,164,255,.32), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, rgba(255,155,56,.18), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbff 0%,#edf3fb 48%,#e9f0f8 100%);
    }

    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}

    .wrap{
      width:min(1180px,100%);
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:24px 16px 64px;
    }

    .topbar{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:14px;
      margin-bottom:22px;
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      font-weight:950;
      letter-spacing:-.01em;
      color:#112038;
    }

    .brand-mark{
      width:42px;
      height:42px;
      border-radius:15px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,#10243b,#2f6eea);
      color:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 16px 38px rgba(47,110,234,.24);
      font-weight:950;
      letter-spacing:.02em;
    }

    .top-pill{
      min-height:36px;
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:0 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.85rem;
      font-weight:850;
      backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    }

    .hero{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;
      gap:22px;
      align-items:stretch;
    }

    .hero-copy{
      min-height:560px;
      border-radius:38px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:42px;
      backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      justify-content:center;
    }

    .eyebrow{
      width:max-content;
      max-width:100%;
      min-height:34px;
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      padding:0 13px;
      border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(47,110,234,.10);
      color:#2358bd;
      font-weight:950;
      font-size:.8rem;
      letter-spacing:.08em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }

    h1{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(2.45rem,6.6vw,5.4rem);
      line-height:.92;
      letter-spacing:-.075em;
      color:#0e1b2c;
    }

    .lead{
      margin:22px 0 0;
      color:#56667d;
      font-size:clamp(1.02rem,2.1vw,1.22rem);
      line-height:1.58;
      max-width:680px;
    }

    .hero-actions{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:10px;
      margin-top:28px;
    }

    .mini-stat{
      min-height:46px;
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:9px;
      padding:0 14px;
      border-radius:16px;
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      color:#1d2e46;
      font-weight:900;
      box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(23,34,52,.07);
    }

    .mini-dot{
      width:10px;
      height:10px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:var(--green);
      box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(24,169,87,.12);
    }

    .hero-visual{
      min-height:560px;
      border-radius:38px;
      overflow:hidden;
      position:relative;
      background:
        linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(7,20,33,.96),rgba(13,34,56,.78)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 28% 22%,rgba(106,164,255,.28),transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 76% 76%,rgba(255,155,56,.22),transparent 28%);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.32);
    }

    .premium-road{
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(120deg,transparent 0 38%,rgba(255,255,255,.06) 38% 39%,transparent 39% 100%),
        linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(255,255,255,.08),transparent 42%);
      opacity:.9;
    }

    .car-silhouette{
      position:absolute;
      left:50%;
      top:51%;
      transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
      width:min(470px,88%);
      height:190px;
      border-radius:80px 110px 42px 42px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.18),rgba(255,255,255,.05)),
        linear-gradient(135deg,#1b3658,#081522);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      box-shadow:0 38px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.42);
    }

    .car-silhouette:before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:88px;
      top:-40px;
      width:230px;
      height:92px;
      border-radius:85px 95px 0 0;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(106,164,255,.22),rgba(255,255,255,.05));
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
    }

    .wheel{
      position:absolute;
      bottom:-28px;
      width:78px;
      height:78px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:#050b13;
      border:10px solid #22334a;
      box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 8px #0b1624;
    }

    .wheel.left{left:78px}
    .wheel.right{right:82px}

    .plate-demo{
      position:absolute;
      left:50%;
      bottom:36px;
      transform:translateX(-50%);
      padding:8px 14px;
      border-radius:8px;
      background:#f7f8fb;
      color:#0e1b2c;
      font-weight:950;
      letter-spacing:.08em;
      box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.45);
      white-space:nowrap;
    }

    .qr-floating{
      position:absolute;
      right:26px;
      top:26px;
      width:142px;
      border-radius:24px;
      background:#fff;
      padding:13px;
      box-shadow:0 28px 65px rgba(0,0,0,.24);
      z-index:4;
    }

    .fake-qr{
      aspect-ratio:1;
      border-radius:13px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg,#111 9px,transparent 9px) 0 0/22px 22px,
        linear-gradient(#111 9px,transparent 9px) 0 0/22px 22px,
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 24%,#111 0 7px,transparent 8px),
        #fff;
      opacity:.9;
    }

    .qr-floating div:last-child{
      margin-top:8px;
      text-align:center;
      color:#111827;
      font-weight:950;
      font-size:.72rem;
    }

    .notification-card{
      position:absolute;
      left:26px;
      bottom:28px;
      width:min(360px,calc(100% - 52px));
      border-radius:26px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.62);
      padding:18px;
      box-shadow:0 26px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
      z-index:5;
      backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    }

    .bell-row{
      display:flex;
      gap:12px;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .bell-icon{
      width:46px;
      height:46px;
      border-radius:17px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9b38,#ffbd73);
      color:#201207;
      font-size:1.32rem;
      box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(255,155,56,.28);
      flex:0 0 auto;
    }

    .notif-title{
      font-weight:950;
      color:#111827;
      line-height:1.15;
    }

    .notif-text{
      margin-top:9px;
      color:#536174;
      line-height:1.42;
      font-size:.94rem;
    }

    .section{
      margin-top:30px;
    }

    .section-head{
      margin-bottom:16px;
    }

    .section-title{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3.6vw,2.7rem);
      line-height:1;
      letter-spacing:-.055em;
      color:#0e1b2c;
    }

    .section-copy{
      margin:13px 0 0;
      color:#5c6b81;
      line-height:1.58;
      font-size:1.04rem;
      max-width:820px;
    }

    .steps{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
      gap:14px;
    }

    .step{
      min-height:230px;
      border-radius:28px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.84);
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      box-shadow:0 18px 48px rgba(23,34,52,.08);
      padding:20px;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .step:after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      right:-28px;
      top:-28px;
      width:88px;
      height:88px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:rgba(47,110,234,.08);
    }

    .num{
      width:36px;
      height:36px;
      border-radius:14px;
      background:#0e1b2c;
      color:#fff;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      font-weight:950;
      margin-bottom:16px;
      position:relative;
      z-index:2;
    }

    .step h3{
      margin:0;
      font-size:1.08rem;
      letter-spacing:-.025em;
      color:#14233a;
      position:relative;
      z-index:2;
    }

    .step p{
      margin:10px 0 0;
      color:#607086;
      line-height:1.5;
      font-size:.94rem;
      position:relative;
      z-index:2;
    }

    .two-col{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:18px;
      align-items:stretch;
    }

    .panel{
      border-radius:34px;
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:28px;
      overflow:hidden;
      position:relative;
    }

    .panel.dark{
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,#071421,#102a46);
      color:#fff;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
    }

    .panel h2{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2.15rem);
      line-height:1.05;
      letter-spacing:-.045em;
    }

    .panel p{
      margin:13px 0 0;
      color:#637289;
      line-height:1.58;
    }

    .panel.dark p{
      color:rgba(255,255,255,.74);
    }

    .phone-detail{
      margin-top:22px;
      border-radius:30px;
      background:#07111f;
      border:8px solid #111827;
      width:min(310px,100%);
      min-height:520px;
      padding:16px;
      color:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.30);
      margin-left:auto;
      margin-right:auto;
    }

    .phone-top{
      width:76px;
      height:18px;
      border-radius:0 0 14px 14px;
      background:#111827;
      margin:-16px auto 16px;
    }

    .detail-box{
      border-radius:22px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      padding:14px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .detail-label{
      color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);
      text-transform:uppercase;
      font-weight:850;
      letter-spacing:.06em;
      font-size:.72rem;
    }

    .detail-value{
      margin-top:7px;
      font-weight:900;
      line-height:1.35;
    }

    .maps-btn{
      margin-top:10px;
      min-height:42px;
      border-radius:15px;
      background:#2f6eea;
      color:#fff;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      font-weight:950;
    }

    .map-visual{
      min-height:520px;
      border-radius:34px;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
      background:
        linear-gradient(145deg,#f8fbff,#e4edf8),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%,rgba(47,110,234,.14),transparent 25%);
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .map-grid{
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(23,34,52,.06) 1px,transparent 1px) 0 0/42px 42px,
        linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(23,34,52,.06) 1px,transparent 1px) 0 0/42px 42px;
      opacity:.6;
    }

    .precise-pin{
      position:absolute;
      left:52%;
      top:42%;
      transform:translate(-50%,-100%);
      width:58px;
      height:58px;
      border-radius:50% 50% 50% 8px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d92d20,#ff6b5f);
      transform-origin:center;
      rotate:-45deg;
      box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(217,45,32,.30);
      border:4px solid #fff;
      z-index:5;
    }

    .precise-pin:after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:15px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:#fff;
    }

    .maps-label{
      position:absolute;
      left:24px;
      right:24px;
      bottom:24px;
      border-radius:24px;
      background:#fff;
      padding:18px;
      box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(23,34,52,.16);
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      z-index:6;
    }

    .maps-label strong{
      display:block;
      font-size:1.04rem;
      color:#111827;
    }

    .maps-label span{
      display:block;
      margin-top:6px;
      color:#607086;
      line-height:1.42;
      font-size:.94rem;
    }

    .area-map{
      margin-top:18px;
      min-height:340px;
      border-radius:30px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(145deg,#ffffff,#eef5ff);
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .area-map:before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:24px;
      border-radius:40px;
      border:3px dashed rgba(47,110,234,.16);
      transform:rotate(8deg);
    }

    .activity-dot{
      position:absolute;
      width:42px;
      height:42px;
      border-radius:50%;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      color:#fff;
      font-weight:950;
      background:#2f6eea;
      border:4px solid #fff;
      box-shadow:0 14px 32px rgba(47,110,234,.26);
    }

    .activity-dot.orange{background:#ff9b38;color:#1f1408}
    .activity-dot.green{background:#18a957}
    .ad1{left:28%;top:28%}
    .ad2{left:61%;top:42%}
    .ad3{left:46%;top:68%}

    .case-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:14px;
    }

    .case{
      min-height:240px;
      border-radius:30px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,20,33,.08),rgba(7,20,33,.62)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 34% 24%,rgba(255,255,255,.8),transparent 18%),
        linear-gradient(135deg,#dce8f5,#9fb6cf);
      overflow:hidden;
      position:relative;
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      box-shadow:0 20px 52px rgba(23,34,52,.10);
    }

    .case:nth-child(2){
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,20,33,.05),rgba(7,20,33,.66)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 68% 20%,rgba(255,255,255,.72),transparent 18%),
        linear-gradient(135deg,#ebd7b6,#667b8f);
    }

    .case:nth-child(3){
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,20,33,.05),rgba(7,20,33,.68)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 24% 18%,rgba(255,155,56,.35),transparent 20%),
        linear-gradient(135deg,#213248,#66758b);
    }

    .case .mock-car{
      position:absolute;
      left:50%;
      top:46%;
      transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
      width:78%;
      height:86px;
      border-radius:50px 70px 24px 24px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#17263a,#0b1420);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
      box-shadow:0 22px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
    }

    .case .mock-car:before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:22%;
      top:-28px;
      width:44%;
      height:48px;
      border-radius:45px 45px 0 0;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    }

    .case-title{
      position:absolute;
      left:18px;
      right:18px;
      bottom:18px;
      color:#fff;
      font-weight:950;
      font-size:1.1rem;
      line-height:1.12;
      text-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      z-index:3;
    }

    .note-card{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:14px;
    }

    .note{
      border-radius:26px;
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid rgba(23,34,52,.10);
      padding:20px;
      box-shadow:0 16px 42px rgba(23,34,52,.07);
    }

    .note-icon{
      width:40px;
      height:40px;
      border-radius:15px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      background:rgba(47,110,234,.10);
      color:#2358bd;
      font-size:1.12rem;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .note h3{
      margin:0;
      font-size:1.05rem;
      letter-spacing:-.02em;
    }

    .note p{
      margin:9px 0 0;
      color:#607086;
      line-height:1.52;
      font-size:.94rem;
    }

    .security{
      border-radius:34px;
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,#071421,#102a46);
      color:#fff;
      padding:30px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;
      gap:20px;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .security h2{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.55rem,3.4vw,2.45rem);
      line-height:1.02;
      letter-spacing:-.05em;
    }

    .security p{
      color:rgba(255,255,255,.74);
      line-height:1.58;
    }

    .security-list{
      display:grid;
      gap:10px;
    }

    .security-item{
      display:flex;
      gap:11px;
      align-items:flex-start;
      padding:14px;
      border-radius:20px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
      color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);
      line-height:1.42;
    }

    .check{
      width:24px;
      height:24px;
      border-radius:999px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      background:#18a957;
      color:#fff;
      font-size:.82rem;
      font-weight:950;
      flex:0 0 auto;
    }

    .cta{
      margin-top:30px;
      border-radius:34px;
      padding:28px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2f6eea,#173a62);
      color:#fff;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:18px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .cta h2{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.35rem,3vw,2rem);
      letter-spacing:-.04em;
    }

    .cta p{
      margin:8px 0 0;
      color:rgba(255,255,255,.76);
      line-height:1.48;
    }

    .cta .button{
      min-height:50px;
      padding:0 18px;
      border-radius:17px;
      background:#fff;
      color:#173a62;
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      font-weight:950;
      white-space:nowrap;
      box-shadow:0 18px 42px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    }

    @media(max-width:980px){
      .hero,.two-col,.security{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
      .case-grid,.note-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .hero-copy,.hero-visual{min-height:auto}
      .hero-copy{padding:30px 24px}
      .hero-visual{min-height:520px}
      .cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
      .cta .button{width:100%}
    }

    @media(max-width:620px){
      .wrap{padding:18px 12px 46px}
      .topbar{align-items:flex-start}
      .top-pill{display:none}
      .hero-copy{border-radius:30px}
      .hero-visual{border-radius:30px;min-height:500px}
      .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .qr-floating{
        width:112px;
        right:16px;
        top:16px;
      }
      .notification-card{
        left:16px;
        right:16px;
        bottom:18px;
        width:auto;
      }
      .car-silhouette{
        width:92%;
        height:160px;
      }
      .wheel{width:66px;height:66px}
      .wheel.left{left:52px}
      .wheel.right{right:56px}
      .panel{padding:22px}
      .phone-detail{min-height:490px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">CV</div>
        <div>Contatto Veicolo</div>
      </div>
      <div class="top-pill">Guida proprietario</div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">Come funziona</div>
        <h1>La tua App personale per ricevere avvisi sul veicolo.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Contatto Veicolo collega il QR esposto sul mezzo alla tua Web App proprietario.
          Chi nota un problema può inviarti una segnalazione riservata, senza vedere il tuo numero.
          Tu ricevi una notifica e accedi subito ai dettagli utili.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <div class="mini-stat"><span class="mini-dot"></span> Notifiche immediate</div>
          <div class="mini-stat"><span class="mini-dot"></span> Posizione precisa se condivisa</div>
          <div class="mini-stat"><span class="mini-dot"></span> Gestione dalla tua App</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="premium-road"></div>
        <div class="qr-floating">
          <div class="fake-qr"></div>
          <div>QR VEICOLO</div>
        </div>
        <div class="car-silhouette">
          <div class="wheel left"></div>
          <div class="wheel right"></div>
          <div class="plate-demo">AH 123 ZW</div>
        </div>
        <div class="notification-card">
          <div class="bell-row">
            <div class="bell-icon">🔔</div>
            <div>
              <div class="notif-title">Vetro abbassato · AH 123 ZW</div>
              <div class="notif-text">Tocca la notifica per aprire subito il dettaglio della segnalazione.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 class="section-title">Il flusso è semplice.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">
          Prima prepari la tua App, poi esponi il QR. Da quel momento ogni segnalazione arriva in modo ordinato nella tua area proprietario.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps">
        <article class="step">
          <div class="num">1</div>
          <h3>Installa l’App proprietario</h3>
          <p>Salva la Web App sul telefono e attiva le notifiche. È il passaggio indispensabile per ricevere gli avvisi.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <div class="num">2</div>
          <h3>Esponi il QR</h3>
          <p>Stampa o mostra il QR associato al tuo veicolo. L’esempio usa una targa fittizia: AH 123 ZW.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <div class="num">3</div>
          <h3>Il passante segnala</h3>
          <p>Chi nota un problema seleziona il motivo, aggiunge un messaggio se serve e può condividere la posizione.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <div class="num">4</div>
          <h3>Ricevi tutto nella tua App</h3>
          <p>Toccando la notifica apri direttamente il dettaglio: motivo, testo, data, ora e posizione se indicata.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section two-col">
      <div class="panel dark">
        <h2>La notifica apre subito il dettaglio.</h2>
        <p>
          Quando ricevi una notifica e la tocchi, non arrivi a una pagina generica:
          si apre direttamente la segnalazione nella tua App proprietario.
        </p>

        <div class="phone-detail">
          <div class="phone-top"></div>

          <div class="detail-box">
            <div class="detail-label">Motivo</div>
            <div class="detail-value">Situazione sospetta</div>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-box">
            <div class="detail-label">Messaggio</div>
            <div class="detail-value">Ho notato una situazione anomala vicino al veicolo.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-box">
            <div class="detail-label">Posizione evento</div>
            <div class="detail-value">Posizione precisa disponibile</div>
            <div class="maps-btn">Apri Maps</div>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-box">
            <div class="detail-label">Targa</div>
            <div class="detail-value">AH 123 ZW</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Se condivisa, la posizione è precisa.</h2>
        <p>
          La posizione della segnalazione non è una stima generica: se il passante la condivide,
          ricevi il punto preciso dell’evento e puoi aprirlo direttamente in Maps.
        </p>

        <div class="map-visual">
          <div class="map-grid"></div>
          <div class="precise-pin"></div>
          <div class="maps-label">
            <strong>Posizione precisa dell’evento</strong>
            <span>È il punto in cui viene inviata la segnalazione. Non è tracciamento continuo del segnalatore.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 class="section-title">Situazioni reali in cui il QR diventa utile.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy">
          Il servizio è pensato per problemi concreti: piccoli incidenti, attenzione al veicolo, ostacoli, situazioni anomale o urgenze da segnalare rapidamente.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="case-grid">
        <article class="case">
          <div class="mock-car"></div>
          <div class="case-title">Vetro abbassato o veicolo esposto a rischio</div>
        </article>

        <article class="case">
          <div class="mock-car"></div>
          <div class="case-title">Animale in auto o situazione da verificare</div>
        </article>

        <article class="case">
          <div class="mock-car"></div>
          <div class="case-title">Situazione sospetta attorno al veicolo</div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section two-col">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Mappa attività del QR.</h2>
        <p>
          Separatamente dalla posizione precisa della singola segnalazione, la tua App può mostrarti
          le aree indicative da cui il QR viene inquadrato e quante attività sono state registrate.
        </p>

        <div class="area-map">
          <div class="activity-dot ad1">3</div>
          <div class="activity-dot ad2 orange">1</div>
          <div class="activity-dot ad3 green">5</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Due informazioni diverse, entrambe utili.</h2>
        <div class="note-card" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:18px;">
          <div class="note">
            <div class="note-icon">📍</div>
            <h3>Posizione della segnalazione</h3>
            <p>È precisa, se condivisa dal passante, e si apre direttamente in Maps.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="note">
            <div class="note-icon">◉</div>
            <h3>Area indicativa di accesso</h3>
            <p>Mostra le zone da cui il QR viene inquadrato o utilizzato, con conteggio attività.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="note">
            <div class="note-icon">🔔</div>
            <h3>Notifiche operative</h3>
            <p>Per ricevere gli avvisi, la tua App deve essere installata e le notifiche devono essere attive.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section security">
      <div>
        <h2>Controllo e sicurezza senza allarmare.</h2>
        <p>
          Il sistema è pensato per segnalazioni reali. Se dovessi ricevere messaggi impropri o ripetuti,
          hai strumenti di gestione direttamente nella tua App.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="security-list">
        <div class="security-item">
          <span class="check">✓</span>
          <span>Puoi bloccare l’accesso del mittente in caso di uso improprio o segnalazioni ripetute.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="security-item">
          <span class="check">✓</span>
          <span>Puoi segnalare un possibile malfunzionamento del sistema.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="security-item">
          <span class="check">✓</span>
          <span>Le segnalazioni ricevute restano consultabili nella tua App.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="security-item">
          <span class="check">✓</span>
          <span>Puoi cancellare le segnalazioni quando non ti servono più.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="note-card">
        <div class="note">
          <div class="note-icon">🔒</div>
          <h3>Numero riservato</h3>
          <p>Il tuo numero non viene mostrato nella pagina pubblica del QR.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="note">
          <div class="note-icon">📌</div>
          <h3>Posizione facoltativa</h3>
          <p>Il passante decide se condividerla. Se lo fa, ricevi il punto preciso della segnalazione.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="note">
          <div class="note-icon">112</div>
          <h3>Emergenze reali</h3>
          <p>In caso di emergenza, la pagina invita il passante a contattare subito il 112.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div>
        <h2>Il servizio funziona quando l’App è pronta.</h2>
        <p>Installa la tua App proprietario, attiva le notifiche e fai una prova di segnalazione.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button" href="/owner-login.html">Apri App proprietario</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
